{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11mini_level_act11mini_st06","groupId":"act11mini","stageId":null,"title":"真實故事","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st06.txt","sourceHash":"77fce61306416fe555c1a4f7639532111fab8888a9d5b535d72cedefca61b2a4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"假扮獄警的傑斯頓遭到逮捕，成了曼斯菲爾德監獄中一名普通的犯人。儘管遭受著種種嘲諷和苛待，他仍然因為一封寄給自己的信燃起了希望。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>親愛的K先生：</i>\n<i>祝您一切順利。我在凌晨的曼斯菲爾德監獄裡給您寫信。</i>\n<i>這裡的情況同我潛入時相比，沒有多大變化。</i>\n<i>獄警們耀武揚威、無所事事，犯人們把過剩的精力發洩在打架鬥毆之中。</i>\n<i>至於我，犯人和獄警們待我很——</i>\n傑斯頓對著“很”字沉思了片刻，從枕頭套裡翻出一封泛黃的信，信封上的寄信人是“K先生”，收信人是他自己。\n借著囚室外面的微光，他低聲念著上面的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“請在監獄內安心蟄伏一段時間，切勿惹人關注，不要惹是生非......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“您仍是沙灘傘公司的重要雇員，我們仍為您保留一切職位和待遇......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要您在監獄中表現良好，等到時機成熟，我們一定還您自由，並給予您加倍的補償......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公司的那群人反應太慢，都什麼時候了，才把這封信寄到我手裡。"},{"type":"narration","text":"傑斯頓搖了搖頭，小心翼翼地把信紙折好，塞進信封，放回枕頭套裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*，那麼刺激的夢，居然被一泡尿給毀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，這不是傑斯頓嗎，你又在熬夜寫信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"上周你就寫信，今天你又寫信，你到底是寫給誰的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這和你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好藏著掖著的，就不能給我們看看嗎？你到底在寫什麼呢？向父母要錢？威脅老婆不許出軌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天和別人打了賭的，賭注是十根香煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我你在寫什麼吧。要是贏了煙，我分你一半。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉，我要求你尊重我的隱私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，隱私、隱私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"假扮獄警混進來殺人，人沒殺到，自己倒成了囚犯，就這還裝什麼優雅，要什麼隱私？笑死人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"人都到齊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓還沒來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓？他又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他出門的時候自己不小心，一頭撞在鐵柵欄上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉，我去醫務室了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"醫務室？那你摔得不輕啊，“同事”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，誰絆的你？看在你這段時間老老實實的份上，說出來，我幫你出出氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並沒有人絆我，我是自己撞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別三天兩頭往醫務室跑！誰不知道你比鐵柵欄還硬，瞎往醫務室跑什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人好好幹活！傑斯頓，你過來，我有別的活派給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，我就和其他犯人一樣工作就行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦什麼，過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這是桶，這是清潔劑，拿好了，把整個A區囚室的廁所刷一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，如果這是您安排的任務的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，您還沒給我刷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"用什麼刷子呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你傑斯頓神通廣大，用源石技藝變個鋼絲球出來還不是輕而易舉？去吧！刷完來找我驗收，不乾淨不准吃飯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈、哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所願，獄警先生，畢竟此時此地，您才是掌握權力的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，被人罰刷廁所，他還裝起來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"幹那種髒活，真是辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一點小事而已，沒什麼好在乎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"這是午餐的麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝，瑞克，不枉我上午替你去醫務室打探消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是撞到鐵柵欄，是為我裝病去的醫務室嗎？我都不知道怎麼感謝你好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我的病怎麼樣......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個醫生難纏得要死，我花了一筆小錢才撬開他的嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按他說的，你的肝病已經不能再拖了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你又在這裡“交朋友”了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幹什麼我管不著，但是今天的群架你得參加！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我沒興趣參與你們的娛樂活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"沒興趣？你知道我們A區最近被那幫感染者打得多慘嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"自從你一通瞎折騰把安東尼放跑之後，B區的人越來越無法無天，這都是你的責任，你還好意思不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不去就等著吧，下次你再被人叫去掃廁所，我們會給你準備“驚喜”的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我不像你們這樣粗俗，無法從這種低俗的暴力中得到什麼快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你還是去吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那個叫瑞克的，你才來幾天？我告訴你，離這個人遠點，他可不是什麼好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是好人？怎麼會呢，傑斯頓幫了我不少忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"切，好言難勸該死的鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，一會就開打了，我勸你趕緊過去！遲到了小心我們一起招呼你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（聳肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們非要我到場不可，那我就去看看好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是到場看看——你得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，總之你得給我過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"看看是誰來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你穿囚服的樣子挺好看啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"獄警當膩了，來與我們同樂了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）傑斯頓，我聽說你能和安東尼扳手腕，放倒這些人應該不在話下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼蠢問題。我甚至覺得你在羞辱我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"區區幾個感染者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"請在監獄內安心蟄伏一段時間，切勿惹人關注，不要惹是生非。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"聽見了嗎，感染者渣滓們，傑斯頓說區區幾個感染者，根本不夠他打的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"好哇，我們倒要看看這個假扮的獄警有幾斤幾兩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我們上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，又打起來了——瞧瞧那是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我賭今天A區占上風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就要虧了。我賭A區一點便宜也占不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你在那站著幹什麼，你以為自己是根柱子嗎，打他們啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你這個——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你*哥倫比亞俚語*當內奸是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，A區的混蛋，你們根本不夠我們打的！你們搬的救兵根本不打算幫你們，等著被打死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"打死他們也沒什麼好玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得現在這裡最該揍的不是A區的殘廢，而是這個光說不練的假獄警嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"他剛剛說什麼來著，“區區幾個感染者，根本不夠他打的”，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就看他來氣，他不打我我也要打他一拳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*，我感覺我骨折了......他就是塊鐵疙瘩，打他跟打鋼板沒區別！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘗嘗撬棍的厲害！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"打得好！打這個沒良心的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨）打不痛他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"撬棍彎了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"B區的弱智，這傢伙會法術，你們不知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好像你們拿他有辦法一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，他是你們請來幫場子的，他不出手，你們請他跟請了一尊雕像來有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你可想好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生們，我勸你們冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從一開始就沒答應過要加入你們粗俗的鬥毆，站在這裡已經是我對你們最大程度的忍讓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們還有一點理智，就請給我讓開一條路，讓我離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你還長篇大論上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我們請你來是讓你幫忙的，不是讓你觀戰的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，你是忘不了假扮獄警的時光，跑這兒來回憶過去了是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我一扳手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"手腕生疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生們，我沒心情陪你們繼續鬧下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們越是想擊傷我，越是會傷害到自己本就不健康的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，在鬥毆中得到快樂，我真的不敢恭維這種品味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為囚犯已經夠可悲了，而缺乏最基本審美品味的囚犯......嘖嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"*一連串哥倫比亞俚語*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"弟兄們，我們一起揍他，看他能扛到什麼時候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不是A區的人請來幫場子的嗎？他們自己打起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要不是在牢裡，我現在一定下樓買桶爆米花吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們現在怎麼辦？看戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"看什麼戲，不是說了沒有爆米花吃嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是一起打這個*哥倫比亞俚語*了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你不打架，跑這兒來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我去拿點東西，給大家找點樂子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"（耳語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，記得回來，不回來小心我扒了你的皮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，記住你自己說的。要是你敢弄別的東西回來，我就讓你把撒謊的教訓記一輩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"明白明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"他說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"別管了，等著看戲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我已經有點看膩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"這傑斯頓也真是硬得可以，別人連鋸條都崩了好幾根，他連道傷口都沒有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯們","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯們","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不是我的本意，不過從結果上看，你們似乎已經無力再戰了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的到來加速了你們握手言和的進程，也不失為一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，先生們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“嘩——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼——強酸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，這是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"臭死了，誰從哪兒搞來的臭水？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，你不是很行嗎，不是品味很高嗎，不是誰都拿你沒辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我請你用你自己刷廁所的水洗個澡，你感覺如何啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你要幹嘛？打我？來啊，你剛才不是還要我們冷靜嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"您仍是沙灘傘公司的重要雇員，我們仍為您保留一切職位和待遇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我無意和你們這樣的粗鄙之人過不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"軟蛋！膿包！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們愛怎麼說怎麼說，愛怎麼做怎麼做，但這些穢物傷不了我分毫，這樣的下作手段除了凸顯你們的無聊之外毫無作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我都有點佩服這個人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"走走走，我們都要被你熏死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊回去哭吧，記得上床之前換套衣服，免得把你的床鋪也弄得臭烘烘的，哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我就問你怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我非得給B區那小子加餐不可——等下，那我們剛才打的賭怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是我贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了我說的話了？我賭的是“A區一點便宜也占不到”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你個油嘴滑舌的騙子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓？你怎麼樣，他們沒傷到你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔......臭死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他們對你做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些暗算，不必介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他們怎麼能這樣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有多餘的囚服嗎，借我一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也只有一套換洗的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"......傑斯頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你回自己牢房等一會兒，我去擦個身子，洗洗衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你穿的是濕衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......我剛才不該那麼吝嗇，我把自己換洗的囚服給你帶來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這種天真的同情心......我已經等不及看這個蠢貨讀信之後的蠢臉了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他已經足夠感激我了，接下來就是稍作引導，燃起他的仇恨......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真幸運啊，我短暫的入獄時光中還能有這麼一個消遣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓？你怎麼了，不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說你的事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告裡面說，你的肝病是酗酒導致的，雖然你入獄之後不再接觸酒精，但工作中接觸的化學製品仍然會對你的身體造成損傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生親口跟我說，再這樣下去，你的預期壽命就不太樂觀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，我的妻子，我七八歲的孩子，我害苦你們了，我真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到這個，醫生不光給我看了你的檢測報告，還把你妻子寄來的信給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"信？帕蒂給我寫信了？為什麼會在醫生那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生說，是為了你的健康考慮，他不想讓你太過激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他已經把你的狀況告訴我，現在再瞞著你這封信的事也就沒意義了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"謝天謝地，帕蒂給我來信，我就算死在這也值了！她說什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛......你自己看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但願我上周熬夜模仿的筆跡和他老婆的足夠相似。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"“我懷著悲傷的心情通知你，這樣的生活我再也過不下去了，我決定嫁給比爾——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我——傑斯頓，這真的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂要嫁給我十五歲的弟弟？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（見鬼，他弟弟叫比爾？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——好好想想，是不是還有其他人叫這個名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人，其他人......迪金遜家的木匠，我入獄前剛死了老婆的那個？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我要當面找帕蒂對質！她怎麼能因為這種事就拋下我，讓我們的孩子管那個又老又瘸的木匠叫爸爸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，瑞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，我真是——我不知說什麼好，如果不是你把這封信帶給我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克，現在不是說謝謝的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說謝謝的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，在哥倫比亞，一切都逃不開金錢或權力的支配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想，為什麼帕蒂會跟那個木匠跑掉？因為錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你進了監獄，成了她的負擔，所以她寧可嫁給一個又老又瘸的傢伙，也不願繼續留在深愛著她的你的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想復仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"復仇？不，我只是想當面問問帕蒂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？你就打算這麼放過她？就算你想放過她，難道你連自己的孩子都不要了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為帕蒂愛你，你也愛她，可是在哥倫比亞，愛能賣多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂背叛了你，她還要教你的孩子學會如何背叛自己真正的父親！難道你心中沒有一絲憤怒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，求你別說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個天真過頭的傻瓜......看來我得說得更直白一點。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒問題的。就算告訴他我很快就能出去，這個蠢貨也不會嫉妒，只會羡慕我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們只有一個選擇，那就是把金錢和權力攥到自己的手裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"金錢......和權力？這些東西怎麼讓我奪回自己的孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了金錢，你就可以交一筆保證金，透過假釋離開這個鬼地方，從帕蒂手裡把自己的孩子搶回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是有錢，一開始就不會被人陷害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只剩權力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞你說，我在這座監獄內外都有一些關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一些很可靠的朋友，他們過段時日就會把我撈出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經過這麼多年的摸爬滾打，我多多少少也摸到了權力的邊緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之所以會被困在這座監獄裡，不過是因為一些不幸的意外和拖延，只是一些小插曲罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓，謝謝你，謝謝你願意和我這樣一個苦命人說話，幫我辦事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自信一點，瑞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥倫比亞，只要你自己足夠有用，或者有人願意拉你一把，你就不會永遠是一個苦命人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不誇張地說，我屬於前者，而你則是後者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"後者——有人願意拉我一把......難道你願意幫我出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算把自己的一些關係介紹給你，讓你也能和上面的那些人說上話，假以時日......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克·格雷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"是——到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"出去，有人找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"別磨磨蹭蹭的！你這個走了狗屎運的混蛋，你家裡人籌到了足夠的保證金，趕緊去辦你的假釋手續！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰......是誰給我籌的錢？我的父親嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"別問東問西的了，你到底還想不想出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"求您了，請您告訴我，究竟是誰給我交的保證金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦！是個叫帕蒂的，和你一個姓，滿意了吧？趕緊滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，“同事”，我們又見面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能有人給這個窮鬼交保證金？難道是你們——不，這不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不可能，誰會為了一個囚犯掏錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，別以為我不知道你搞的這些小把戲。你愛“交朋友”的習慣已經連典獄長都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"他特地讓我來看著你一點，別讓你搞出什麼亂子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以還是你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"別搞錯了，這傢伙真的只是運氣好而已。他老婆好像是賣了房子還是怎麼樣，反正湊夠了保證金，就這麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"要說我們在其中起了什麼作用......我們只是小小地拖延了一下辦事手續而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖延？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一周前就知道他老婆湊夠保證金了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"這一周看你跑上跑下，拿自己那點可憐兮兮的錢到處打點關係——噗，噗哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你兜裡還剩幾個錢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"傑斯頓目露凶光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"只要您在監獄中表現良好，等到時機成熟，我們一定還您自由，並給予您加倍的補償。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的物質開始在他手上凝結——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，你想來真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後消退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有愚人才用暴力發洩自己的憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"真遺憾，自從安東尼越獄之後，上面就給我們配發了超大功率的電擊槍，我還想試試呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去在其他人身上試吧，你很快就沒機會再見到我了，粗魯的獄警先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，也有人給你交保證金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保證金......當然會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更有趣了，既然有人給你交保證金，為什麼你還沒像那個瑞克一樣走人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"淺薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為真正掌握著金錢和權力的人會用錢從監獄裡撈人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，口氣不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳述事實而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就祝你早日被人撈出去，而且是不用錢的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在你還是曼斯菲爾德監獄的犯人，懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"懂就拿著這個桶和這瓶清潔劑，你還有C區的廁所沒刷呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>親愛的K先生：</i>\n<i>祝您一切順利。我在凌晨的曼斯菲爾德監獄裡給您寫信。</i>\n<i>這裡的情況同我潛入時相比，沒有多大變化。</i>\n<i>獄警們耀武揚威、無所事事，犯人們把過剩的精力發洩在打架鬥毆之中。</i>\n<i>尊敬的先生，請務必抓緊時間營救我出獄。</i>\n<i>我深知，以您的實力，營救我這樣的人不過是小事一樁。</i>\n<i>您在信中告訴我，我是沙灘傘公司的重要雇員，但我心裡明白，我不過是無數員工中的一個，只不過比他人多一些力量，因此多一些價值罷了。</i>\n<i>我懇請您儘早讓我離開這個地方，我害怕過久的牢獄生活會使我失去往日的鋒利，不能再為您提供足夠的價值。</i>\n<i>您忠實的......</i>\n傑斯頓在落款處停住了。\n他用力握著筆桿，牙關緊咬，最終劃去了原來的落款。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“您最最謙卑的僕人，傑斯頓·威廉姆斯。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣......這樣應該足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神，傑斯頓，打起精神......你是沙灘傘公司連續五年的最佳員工，他們不會放棄你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會放棄你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，他們一定不會放棄你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了，就快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出去之後，一定要想個法子讓這群下作的囚犯和獄警——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，這個還是等出去之後再說吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傑斯頓·威廉姆斯將何去何從？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沙灘傘公司的K先生會不會對他們困境中的員工施以援手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請鎖定58台，下周同一時間，我們繼續為您帶來《真實故事》第173期！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A&路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈、哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這節目我追定了，叫什麼來著，《真實故事》是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我就說你會喜歡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我是這個節目的老觀眾了，但像這個演傑斯頓的演員這麼好的演技，我還是頭一回見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"看來58台也下了血本了，這麼好的演員，他們從哪找到的？他以前演過別的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。《真實故事》這節目主打的就是偽紀錄片，從來不放演職員表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是哪個表演學院新畢業的學生吧，我打賭他未來一片光明，前途大好，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"敬前途大好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"敬前途大好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"這酒真不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好酒，好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我說啊，我就一說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"假如那人不是演員，真是犯人——你覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你這笑話講得真不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"太好笑了，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（音樂）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"《真實故事》為虛構作品，如有雷同，純屬巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們下期節目再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
